<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels for demolition.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final as they may be subject to survey, inspection or other conditions.</p>
<p>TANKER.</p>
<p>Petro Aberdeen - (built 1967) 111,052 sold for $188 plt to India.</p>
<p>BULKER/OILER.</p>
<p>Sonata I - (built 1972) 77,987 sold for $175 plt to India.</p>
<p>RO-RO/CONTAINER.</p>
<p>Anro Asia - (built 1978) 22,061 sold for $156 plt to cash buyers asis Singapore.</p>
</text>
